==Description==

The '''Std Recompute''' command recomputes selected objects ({{Version|26.3}}), or the active document if no objects are selected.

==Usage==

# Optionally select one or more objects.
# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Use the keyboard shortcut: {{KEY|Ctrl}}+{{KEY|Shift}}+{{KEY|R}}.
#* If objects have been selected: Select the {{MenuCommand|[[Image:Std_Recompute.svg|16px]] Recompute Object}} option from the [[Tree_view|Tree view]] context menu.

==Scripting==

See [[Std_Refresh#Scripting|Std Refresh]].


